• Understand the current state of our tech stack, including but not limited to ERP (NetSuite), Coupa, ServiceNow, Workiva, Snowflake, Adaptive (or other EPM tools) etc. and partner with IT to drive implementation of best in class systems and architecture to achieve operational excellence.

• Work with the Leadership team to drive implementation of AI-enabled transformation strategy that enhances customer, vendor and employee experience.

• Lead the development of leading practice PMO playbooks and artifacts. Leverage the playbook to manage and track progress of the transformation initiatives, including managing program plans, RAID logs, project documentation, etc.&nbsp;&nbsp;

• Work with leadership to develop and manage the Transformation Roadmap. Develop business cases for large initiatives, track achievements and support in benefits realization.&nbsp;

• Support in managing transformation budget including monthly forecasting and scenario analysis.&nbsp;

• Build robust communications strategy and support change management efforts.

• Drive the development of change management artifacts such as training materials, communications, etc.

